       "text": "Calling this right now: no matter how bad this story gets, Jensen Huang remains Nvidia CEO. \n\nThe entire AI bubble collapses if investors freak out about Nvidia. It is the ONE reliable picks-and-shovels anchor in the circular financing shitstorm. \n\nEveryone in power will decide to give him a pass."
