        ],
        "text": "Here's what I think happened. \n\nTrump calls Nvidia’s board and says: \"1) if you hire Huang back, I’ll promise no agency investigations; 2) I’ll give you all pardons. . . If you DON'T do that, you're on your own and I can't control what my agencies do.\""
